{
  "id": "grammar-10",
  "world": "grammar",
  "order": 10,
  "type": "grammar",
  "title": "被動語態：be ＋ 過去分詞",
  "titleEn": "Passive Voice",
  "summary": "說「被…」的時候，例如「包裹被寄出了」。",
  "minutes": 15,
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "concept",
      "title": "中文概念",
      "body": [
        "中文說「這封信被寄出了」、「會議被延期了」，英文用 be 動詞 ＋ 過去分詞（p.p.）。",
        "當我們不知道、或不需要說「是誰做的」，就會用被動語態。多益的公告和信件很常用。",
        "判斷方法：主詞「自己做」用主動；主詞「被做」用被動。例如 The report was written by Amy.（報告被艾咪寫好）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "title": "簡單說明",
      "body": [
        "被動語態的樣子："
      ],
      "table": {
        "head": [
          "時間",
          "句型",
          "例子"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "現在",
            "am／is／are ＋ p.p.",
            "Breakfast is served at 7."
          ],
          [
            "過去",
            "was／were ＋ p.p.",
            "The package was sent yesterday."
          ],
          [
            "未來",
            "will be ＋ p.p.",
            "The results will be announced soon."
          ],
          [
            "助動詞",
            "must／can／should be ＋ p.p.",
            "The form must be signed."
          ]
        ]
      },
      "tip": "常見過去分詞：send → sent、hold → held、make → made、write → written、give → given、build → built。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "examples",
      "title": "英文例句",
      "items": [
        {
          "en": "Breakfast is served from 7 to 10.",
          "zh": "早餐供應時間是七點到十點。",
          "highlight": "served",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-10/ex1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "The meeting was postponed.",
          "zh": "會議被延期了。",
          "highlight": "postponed",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-10/ex2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "The building was built in 1990.",
          "zh": "這棟大樓建於 1990 年。",
          "highlight": "built",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-10/ex3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "All forms must be signed.",
          "zh": "所有表格都必須簽名。",
          "highlight": "signed",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-10/ex4.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "breakdown",
      "title": "句子拆解",
      "items": [
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "The package",
              "label": "主詞（被寄的東西）"
            },
            {
              "text": "was",
              "label": "be 動詞（過去）"
            },
            {
              "text": "sent",
              "label": "過去分詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "yesterday.",
              "label": "時間"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "包裹不會自己寄，是「被寄出」，用被動"
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "The results",
              "label": "主詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "will be",
              "label": "未來被動"
            },
            {
              "text": "announced",
              "label": "過去分詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "next week.",
              "label": "時間"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "will be ＋ p.p.：將會被公布"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "contrast",
      "title": "正確與錯誤示範",
      "items": [
        {
          "wrong": "The room is clean every day.",
          "right": "The room is cleaned every day.",
          "why": "房間是「被打掃」，要用過去分詞 cleaned。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "The letter was wrote by Tom.",
          "right": "The letter was written by Tom.",
          "why": "write 的過去分詞是 written。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "The report will finished soon.",
          "right": "The report will be finished soon.",
          "why": "未來被動是 will be ＋ p.p.。"
        }
      ]
    },
